UI FRAME: baseline_text-ru-player_contact.png {"ascent":8.0,"descent":2.0,"effective_size":8,"families":["Arial","Hiragino Sans GB W3"],"font_height":10.0,"height":38.0,"line_count":3,"max_lines":3,"measured":[260.0,30.0],"position":[36.0,152.0],"process_frame":4,"requested_size":11,"styles":["Bold","W3"],"text":"Урон появляется при контакте после замаха. Стрелы и магия летят по выбранной линии: можно промахнуться или попасть в преграду. Входящий удар отменяет ещё не выпущенную атаку.","used_faces":[{"family":"Arial","style":"Bold","weight":700}],"weights":[700,400],"width":268.0}
UI FRAME: baseline_text-ru-fertilizer.png {"ascent":8.0,"descent":2.0,"effective_size":8,"families":["Arial","Hiragino Sans GB W3"],"font_height":10.0,"height":38.0,"line_count":3,"max_lines":3,"measured":[268.0,30.0],"position":[36.0,152.0],"process_frame":12,"requested_size":11,"styles":["Bold","W3"],"text":"Встань лицом к пустой вспаханной грядке и используй удобрение из рюкзака. Компост ускоряет рост на 20%, смесь роста на 35%, смесь урожая даёт +1 плод. Один сбор расходует удобрение.","used_faces":[{"family":"Arial","style":"Bold","weight":700}],"weights":[700,400],"width":268.0}
UI FRAME: baseline_text-de-player_contact.png {"ascent":8.0,"descent":2.0,"effective_size":8,"families":["Arial","Hiragino Sans GB W3"],"font_height":10.0,"height":38.0,"line_count":3,"max_lines":3,"measured":[260.0,30.0],"position":[36.0,152.0],"process_frame":20,"requested_size":11,"styles":["Bold","W3"],"text":"Schaden entsteht erst beim Kontakt nach dem Ausholen. Pfeile und Magie folgen der Ziellinie und können verfehlen oder Deckung treffen. Treffer unterbrechen noch nicht ausgelöste Angriffe.","used_faces":[{"family":"Arial","style":"Bold","weight":700}],"weights":[700,400],"width":268.0}
UI FRAME: production-ru-player_contact.png {"ascent":9.0,"descent":2.0,"effective_size":9,"families":["Arial","Hiragino Sans GB W3"],"font_height":11.0,"height":38.0,"line_count":3,"max_lines":3,"measured":[250.0,33.0],"position":[36.0,152.0],"process_frame":28,"requested_size":11,"styles":["Bold","W3"],"text":"После замаха нужно попасть. Стрелы и магия летят по прицелу, могут промахнуться или попасть в преграду. Удар по тебе отменяет невыпущенную атаку.","used_faces":[{"family":"Arial","style":"Bold","weight":700}],"weights":[700,400],"width":268.0}
UI FRAME: production-ru-fertilizer.png {"ascent":9.0,"descent":2.0,"effective_size":9,"families":["Arial","Hiragino Sans GB W3"],"font_height":11.0,"height":38.0,"line_count":3,"max_lines":3,"measured":[260.0,33.0],"position":[36.0,152.0],"process_frame":36,"requested_size":11,"styles":["Bold","W3"],"text":"Повернись к пустой вспаханной грядке и примени удобрение из рюкзака. Компост: рост +20%, смесь роста: +35%, смесь урожая: +1 плод. На один сбор.","used_faces":[{"family":"Arial","style":"Bold","weight":700}],"weights":[700,400],"width":268.0}
UI FRAME: production-en-player_contact.png {"ascent":9.0,"descent":2.0,"effective_size":9,"families":["Arial","Hiragino Sans GB W3"],"font_height":11.0,"height":38.0,"line_count":3,"max_lines":3,"measured":[264.0,33.0],"position":[36.0,152.0],"process_frame":44,"requested_size":11,"styles":["Bold","W3"],"text":"Damage happens on contact after windup. Arrows and magic follow the aimed line and can miss or hit cover. Getting hit cancels an unreleased attack.","used_faces":[{"family":"Arial","style":"Bold","weight":700}],"weights":[700,400],"width":268.0}
UI FRAME: production-en-fertilizer.png {"ascent":9.0,"descent":2.0,"effective_size":9,"families":["Arial","Hiragino Sans GB W3"],"font_height":11.0,"height":38.0,"line_count":3,"max_lines":3,"measured":[247.0,33.0],"position":[36.0,152.0],"process_frame":52,"requested_size":11,"styles":["Bold","W3"],"text":"Face an empty tilled bed and use fertilizer from your bag. Compost speeds growth 20%, growth mix 35%, yield mix adds one crop. One harvest uses it up.","used_faces":[{"family":"Arial","style":"Bold","weight":700}],"weights":[700,400],"width":268.0}
UI FRAME: production-es-player_contact.png {"ascent":9.0,"descent":2.0,"effective_size":9,"families":["Arial","Hiragino Sans GB W3"],"font_height":11.0,"height":38.0,"line_count":3,"max_lines":3,"measured":[249.0,33.0],"position":[36.0,152.0],"process_frame":60,"requested_size":11,"styles":["Bold","W3"],"text":"El daño llega al contacto tras preparar el golpe. Flechas y magia siguen la línea apuntada y pueden fallar o chocar. Recibir daño cancela el ataque sin lanzar.","used_faces":[{"family":"Arial","style":"Bold","weight":700}],"weights":[700,400],"width":268.0}
UI FRAME: production-es-fertilizer.png {"ascent":9.0,"descent":2.0,"effective_size":9,"families":["Arial","Hiragino Sans GB W3"],"font_height":11.0,"height":38.0,"line_count":3,"max_lines":3,"measured":[258.0,33.0],"position":[36.0,152.0],"process_frame":68,"requested_size":11,"styles":["Bold","W3"],"text":"Mira una parcela arada vacía y usa abono. Compost acelera 20%, mezcla de crecimiento 35%, mezcla de rendimiento da +1 fruto. Dura una cosecha.","used_faces":[{"family":"Arial","style":"Bold","weight":700}],"weights":[700,400],"width":268.0}
UI FRAME: production-de-player_contact.png {"ascent":9.0,"descent":2.0,"effective_size":9,"families":["Arial","Hiragino Sans GB W3"],"font_height":11.0,"height":38.0,"line_count":3,"max_lines":3,"measured":[261.0,33.0],"position":[36.0,152.0],"process_frame":76,"requested_size":11,"styles":["Bold","W3"],"text":"Erst ausholen, dann treffen. Pfeile/Magie folgen der Ziellinie; sie können verfehlen oder Deckung treffen. Gegentreffer stoppen Angriffe vor dem Auslösen.","used_faces":[{"family":"Arial","style":"Bold","weight":700}],"weights":[700,400],"width":268.0}
UI FRAME: production-de-fertilizer.png {"ascent":9.0,"descent":2.0,"effective_size":9,"families":["Arial","Hiragino Sans GB W3"],"font_height":11.0,"height":38.0,"line_count":3,"max_lines":3,"measured":[251.0,33.0],"position":[36.0,152.0],"process_frame":84,"requested_size":11,"styles":["Bold","W3"],"text":"Leeres gepflügtes Beet ansehen und Dünger im Rucksack verwenden. Kompost: +20% Wachstum; Wachstumsmix: +35%; Ertragsmix: +1 Frucht. Gilt für eine Ernte.","used_faces":[{"family":"Arial","style":"Bold","weight":700}],"weights":[700,400],"width":268.0}
UI FRAME: production-fr-player_contact.png {"ascent":9.0,"descent":2.0,"effective_size":9,"families":["Arial","Hiragino Sans GB W3"],"font_height":11.0,"height":38.0,"line_count":3,"max_lines":3,"measured":[264.0,33.0],"position":[36.0,152.0],"process_frame":92,"requested_size":11,"styles":["Bold","W3"],"text":"Les dégâts arrivent au contact après la préparation. Flèches et magie suivent la ligne visée et peuvent rater ou toucher un obstacle. Un coup interrompt une attaque non lancée.","used_faces":[{"family":"Arial","style":"Bold","weight":700}],"weights":[700,400],"width":268.0}
UI FRAME: production-fr-fertilizer.png {"ascent":9.0,"descent":2.0,"effective_size":9,"families":["Arial","Hiragino Sans GB W3"],"font_height":11.0,"height":38.0,"line_count":3,"max_lines":3,"measured":[254.0,33.0],"position":[36.0,152.0],"process_frame":100,"requested_size":11,"styles":["Bold","W3"],"text":"Face à un carré labouré vide, utilise l’engrais du sac. Compost : croissance +20%, mélange +35%, rendement +1 fruit. Une récolte le consomme.","used_faces":[{"family":"Arial","style":"Bold","weight":700}],"weights":[700,400],"width":268.0}
UI FRAME: production-zh-player_contact.png {"ascent":10.0,"descent":3.0,"effective_size":11,"families":["Arial","Hiragino Sans GB W3"],"font_height":13.0,"height":38.0,"line_count":2,"max_lines":3,"measured":[264.0,24.0],"position":[36.0,152.0],"process_frame":108,"requested_size":11,"styles":["Bold","W3"],"text":"前摇后命中才造成伤害。箭矢和魔法沿瞄准线飞行，可能打空或撞到掩体。受到攻击会取消尚未释放的攻击。","used_faces":[{"family":"Hiragino Sans GB W3","style":"W3","weight":400}],"weights":[700,400],"width":268.0}
UI FRAME: production-zh-fertilizer.png {"ascent":10.0,"descent":3.0,"effective_size":11,"families":["Arial","Hiragino Sans GB W3"],"font_height":13.0,"height":38.0,"line_count":2,"max_lines":3,"measured":[265.0,26.0],"position":[36.0,152.0],"process_frame":116,"requested_size":11,"styles":["Bold","W3"],"text":"面向空的已耕田地并在背包使用肥料。堆肥加速20%，生长肥35%，丰收肥多产1个作物。一次收获后消耗。","used_faces":[{"family":"Hiragino Sans GB W3","style":"W3","weight":400},{"family":"Arial","style":"Bold","weight":700}],"weights":[700,400],"width":268.0}
